      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprise administrators can now use telemetry in managed settings to attribute GitHub Copilot activity to a user without collecting their prompts, responses, or tool content.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The telemetry.capture.identity setting adds three attributes to OpenTelemetry (OTel) data:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "user.name : The authenticated Copilot account name, currently the GitHub login.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Identity capture is off by default and remains separate from the existing pseudonymous user identifier.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Fine-grained capture controls are available in Copilot CLI, the GitHub Copilot app, and VS Code sessions using Agent Host.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Administrators can also independently control five additional capture classes:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "prompts : User, system, and developer prompts and supported input context.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The existing captureContent setting remains available as a legacy shorthand for the five content classes, but it never enables identity.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Prompt, tool, and policy capture can include source code, file contents, commands, tool results, and workspace or user-profile paths.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-14T00:18:51.888Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Search and filter for budgets now available",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-12-client-telemetry-user-attribution-and-configurable-capture",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T22:38:00.000Z",
